#!/usr/bin/env bash
# SAOS Quick Reference Card

cat << 'EOF'

╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║         SAOS — SECRET AGENT OPERATING SYSTEM              ║
║                  QUICK REFERENCE v1.0                     ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Window Management:
  Super + Return     Open terminal (Foot)
  Super + D          Application launcher (Fuzzel)
  Super + Q          Kill active window
  Super + F          Fullscreen toggle
  Super + L          Lock screen
  Super + E          File manager (Yazi)

Workspace Navigation:
  Super + 1-9        Switch to workspace N
  Super + Shift + 1-9 Move window to workspace N

Media Controls:
  XF86AudioRaiseVolume    Increase volume
  XF86AudioLowerVolume    Decrease volume
  XF86MonBrightnessUp     Increase brightness
  XF86MonBrightnessDown   Decrease brightness

System:
  Super + Shift + E   Exit Hyprland


SYSTEM COMMANDS
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

View System Info:
  hostnamectl        Hostname
  timedatectl        Date/time/timezone
  systemctl status   Service status
  journalctl -n 50   Last 50 log lines

Package Management:
  sudo pacman -S     Install packages
  sudo pacman -Syyu  Update system
  yay -S             Install from AUR

Face Authentication:
  sudo howdy add     Enroll face ID
  sudo howdy test    Test face authentication


CONFIGURATION FILES
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

User Configs (~/.config/):
  ~/.config/hypr/hyprland.conf      Window manager keybinds
  ~/.config/waybar/config.jsonc     Status bar layout
  ~/.config/foot/foot.ini           Terminal settings
  ~/.config/fuzzel/fuzzel.ini       Launcher settings

System Configs (/etc/):
  /etc/hypr/hyprland.conf           System-wide Hyprland config
  /etc/waybar/config.jsonc          System-wide Waybar config
  /etc/foot/foot.ini                System-wide Foot config
  /etc/NetworkManager/              Network settings
  /etc/greetd/config.toml           Login screen settings


COLOR SCHEME
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Background:     #000000 (Black)
Primary Text:   #00ff41 (Phosphor Green)
Dim Text:       #008f22 (Dark Green)
Borders:        #00ff41 (1px Green)
Alerts:         #ff0033 (Red)
Warnings:       #ffaa00 (Amber)

Font: JetBrains Mono (everywhere)


USEFUL COMMANDS
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

System Monitoring:
  htop                   Process monitor
  systemctl list-units   Running services
  df -h                  Disk usage
  free -h                Memory usage

Desktop:
  waybar --log-level debug    Debug status bar
  hyprctl clients             List open windows
  hyprctl reload              Reload Hyprland config

Network:
  nmcli connection show       List connections
  nmcli device wifi list      Scan WiFi networks
  nmcli device wifi connect   Connect to WiFi


TROUBLESHOOTING
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Black screen / login issues:
  systemctl status greetd
  journalctl -u greetd -n 50

Hyprland won't start:
  hyprland --instance 0 &
  journalctl -xe | grep hyprland

Face ID not working:
  ls /dev/video*              List video devices
  howdy config                Edit Howdy config
  sudo howdy test             Test face detection

Keyboard not responding:
  Check hyprland.conf keybinds
  Press Super + Shift + E to reload


DOCUMENTATION
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Full Specifications:    /usr/share/doc/saos/SPEC.md
Build Instructions:     /usr/share/doc/saos/BUILD_GUIDE.md
Contributing:           /usr/share/doc/saos/CONTRIBUTING.md
Online:                 https://github.com/yourusername/saos

╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║              MISSION PARAMETERS CONFIRMED                 ║
║                   SYSTEM READY                            ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

EOF
